<title>THAILAND: Banpu third quarter net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Banpu third quarter net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		    (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				  1997			  1996</p>
<p>					Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		4.51	vs		3.93</p>
<p>    Net		     236.04	vs	    197.09</p>
<p>					Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     13.07	vs	     12.20</p>
<p>    Net		     677.36	vs	    606.40</p>
<p>NOTE: Results are audited. Banpu Plc is a coal miner and importer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
